	text: [
		"The §6Inspectoris Scandalum§r is a nifty book that can display what blocks are §6required§r, and where they need to be placed, in order to §6upgrade§r a Blood Altar to the next tier. ",
		"",
		"§6Right-clicking§r the book in the §6air§r will §6cycle§r which altar tier it should display. ",
		"",
		"Once a tier has been selected, §6sneak right-click§r the §6blood altar§r to view ghost blocks of the required structure in-world. ",
		"",
		"To §6remove§r the ghost blocks again, set the book to §6tier 1§r and sneak right-click the altar again.",
		"",
		"Note that the §6Betweenstone Bricks§r can be replaced with any other block."
